d-full font-bold flex items-center shadow-lg text-lg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 mr-3 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.588-5.946 0-6.556 5.332-11.888 11.888-11.888 3.176 0 6.161 1.237 8.404 3.48s3.481 5.229 3.481 8.404c0 6.556-5.331 11.888-11.888 11.888-2.003 0-3.963-.505-5.7-1.467l-6.305 1.692zm6.39-4.321c1.556.924 3.167 1.411 4.841 1.411 5.097 0 9.245-4.148 9.245-9.245 0-2.468-.962-4.789-2.709-6.537-1.747-1.747-4.068-2.708-6.536-2.708-5.097 0-9.245 4.148-9.245 9.245 0 1.785.513 3.52 1.484 5.016l-.979 3.575 3.655-.957zm10.334-3.52c-.27-.135-1.598-.788-1.846-.878-.248-.09-.428-.135-.608.135-.18.27-.698.878-.855 1.058-.158.18-.315.203-.585.068-.27-.135-1.14-.421-2.172-1.341-.803-.715-1.346-1.598-1.503-1.868-.158-.27-.017-.417.118-.552.122-.122.27-.315.405-.473.135-.158.18-.27.27-.45.09-.18.045-.338-.023-.473-.068-.135-.608-1.463-.833-2.003-.22-.529-.44-.457-.608-.466-.157-.008-.337-.009-.517-.009-.18 0-.473.068-.72.338-.248.27-.945.923-.945 2.25 0 1.328.968 2.61 1.103 2.79.135.18 1.905 2.909 4.614 4.082.645.278 1.148.445 1.541.569.648.206 1.237.177 1.704.107.52-.078 1.598-.653 1.823-1.283.225-.63.225-1.17.157-1.283-.068-.113-.248-.18-.517-.315z\"/></svg>\n                        Instant B2B Support\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Atlas-Aircon-Panel-Ac-2.png\" alt=\"Panel AC service Bharuch industrial unit\" class=\"rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-white transform lg:scale-105\" title=\"\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-16\">\n        \n        <!-- Technical Introduction -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">Strategic <b>Panel AC service Bharuch</b> for Hazardous Environments</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"prose max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-6\">\n                    <p>\n                        In the corrosive and highly demanding environment of Gujarat&#8217;s Golden Corridor, finding a reliable <b>Panel AC service Bharuch</b> partner is essential for safety and efficiency. Bharuch, encompassing the colossal industrial estates of <b>Ankleshwar GIDC</b> and the <b>Dahej PCPIR</b> region, is home to world-class chemical and petrochemical plants. These facilities often require specialized <b>flame-proof</b> and corrosion-resistant cooling solutions for their DCS and PLC panels.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Our specialized <b>industrial panel AC repair</b> services are engineered to withstand the harsh chemical atmosphere of the region. Whether you operate <b>Rittal</b> NEMA 4X units, <b>Adhunik</b> SS316 enclosure coolers, or <b>Advance Cooling Systems</b>, our technicians are trained in hazardous area protocols. We ensure your electrical panels in hazardous zones (Zone 1 &#038; 2) maintain safe operating temperatures, preventing critical thermal failures in your continuous process plants.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        At <a href=\"/\"><b>Atlas Aircon</b></a>, we provide comprehensive <b>Panel AC service Bharuch</b> solutions. From applying anti-corrosive coatings on condenser coils to <b>industrial compressor replacement</b> and <b>gas charging</b> with chemically stable refrigerants, we serve the heavy industry spectrum from Panoli to Jhagadia.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/panel-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Industrial Panel AC service Bharuch technical diagnostics\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full border-2 border-gray-100\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Specialized Application Section -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20 bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border-l-8 border-primary\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8\">Bharuch District Industrial Expertise</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center\">\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Atlas-Aircon-Panel-Ac-3.png\" alt=\"Chemical Industry Panel AC service Bharuch\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">Chemicals &#038; Petrochemicals</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Serving Ankleshwar and Dahej. We provide anti-corrosive treatments for condenser coils to survive acidic atmospheres.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Walkin-Freezer-Repair-Service.webp\" alt=\"Pharma Panel AC service Bharuch\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">Pharmaceuticals</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Clean room cooling compliance for Panoli and Ankleshwar pharma giants. We service SS304/SS316 units for hygiene areas.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rittal-panel-ac-service.webp\" alt=\"Heavy Industry Panel AC service Bharuch\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">Textiles &#038; Heavy Industry</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">High-capacity panel cooling for Jhagadia&#8217;s glass, rubber, and textile plants. Expert filter management for high-dust zones.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Pros and Cons -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">7 Major Pros and Cons of Industrial Service</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                <div class=\"p-8 bg-green-50 rounded-2xl border border-green-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-green-700\">Advantages (Pros)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm\">\n                        <li><b>Process Safety:</b> Regular <b>Panel AC service Bharuch</b> prevents thermal trips in critical chemical reactors.</li>\n                        <li><b>Corrosion Control:</b> Special coatings extend the life of copper coils in acidic air.</li>\n                        <li><b>Electronics Longevity:</b> Keeps DCS and PLC cards cool, preventing expensive logic failures.</li>\n                        <li><b>Energy Efficiency:</b> Clean heat exchangers significantly reduce power consumption in large plants.</li>\n                        <li><b>IP Rating Integrity:</b> We ensure door gaskets seal perfectly to keep hazardous gases out.</li>\n                        <li><b>Fire Prevention:</b> Reduces the risk of electrical fires in flame-proof enclosures.</li>\n                        <li><b>Compliance:</b> Service records assist in safety and environmental audits (GPCB/ISO).</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-8 bg-red-50 rounded-2xl border border-red-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-red-700\">Neglect Risks (Cons)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm\">\n                        <li><b>Plant Shutdown:</b> A single panel failure can trip an entire chemical processing train.</li>\n                        <li><b>Acid Damage:</b> Neglected coils corrode rapidly in Ankleshwar, leading to refrigerant leaks.</li>\n                        <li><b>Explosion Risk:</b> Overheating in hazardous areas can be catastrophic.</li>\n                        <li><b>High Replacement Costs:</b> Replacing a specialized flame-proof AC is 5x the cost of maintenance.</li>\n                        <li><b>Data Loss:</b> Heat stress causes SCADA systems to crash or corrupt data.</li>\n                        <li><b>Voided Warranty:</b> Manufacturers deny claims if units show signs of corrosion neglect.</li>\n                        <li><b>Emergency Costs:</b> Urgent repairs in Dahej SEZ incur premium charges and logistic delays.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Brands We Service -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">Leading Industrial Brands Supported</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-10 text-gray-600\">We specialize in a massive array of global and Indian brands. We use only high-grade spares and do not claim to be authorized service providers, allowing us to provide faster, more cost-effective solutions for the Bharuch industrial belt.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Rittal</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Adhunik</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Advance Cooling</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Hoffman</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Schneider</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Pfannenberg</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Cosmotec</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Daikin</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Mitsubishi</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Blue Star</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Seifert</div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg text-center font-bold hover:shadow-md transition\">Voltas</div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Pricing Table -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20 bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border-t-8 border-secondary\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Bharuch Service &#038; Spares Price List (2026)</h2>\n            <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-gray-100\">\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Item Description</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Estimated Price (INR)</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Grade</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Action</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b